sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Participant
 participant UI as ChatPages
 participant API as Transactions API
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 U->>UI: Select peer and product A
 activate UI
 UI->>API: listChatSessions
 activate API
 API->>DB: Read sessions where actor is buyer or seller
 DB-->>API: Authorized sessions for products A and B
 API-->>UI: Session DTOs with peer and context
 deactivate API
 UI->>API: listMessages and listSessionOffers per session
 API-->>UI: Messages and offers carrying session IDs
 UI-->>U: One peer timeline, context labels preserved
 U->>UI: Switch current context to product B
 UI->>UI: Locate latest loaded B entry, preserve composer text
 U->>UI: Send message for B
 UI->>API: sendMessage(session B, clientMsgId, content)
 activate API
 API->>DB: Check participant and deduplicate client ID
 alt Valid participant and new client ID
  API->>DB: Insert message and notification, commit
  API-->>UI: Persisted message for B
 else Different payload reused with same client ID
  API-->>UI: MESSAGE_ID_CONFLICT
 else Unauthorized session
  API-->>UI: FORBIDDEN
 end
 deactivate API
 deactivate UI
